# Contact-form delivery (Web3Forms).
#
# Get a key with no signup: https://web3forms.com — enter the inbox address that
# should receive enquiries, and they email you the access key.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below. Vite only exposes variables
# prefixed with VITE_, and it INLINES them into the built bundle — this key is
# public by design (it can only deliver TO your inbox, never read it).
#
# Without this set, the form runs in mock mode: it shows a "demo" notice and
# sends nothing.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
